; A comparison answers 0 or 1, which is what `%` already reads — so a quantity
; steers a text-plane program with no control flow added to either side.
;
; Two calls: the branch that was taken, and nothing else. `absent` proves the
; other branch never ran.
; expect: calls 1
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
; expect: absent unreachable
(% |([less] 2 3)|
   "Answer with exactly the word: taken"
   "Answer with exactly the word: unreachable")
